  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Acción principal con oro y tinta grafito.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-primary\">Save changes</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:var(--kma-control-height,40px);padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;background:var(--kma-accent,#d6a43a);color:var(--kma-accent-fg,#1c1f22);transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-button-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--kma-accent,#d6a43a) 88%,var(--kma-surface,#fffefc));}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--kma-primary,#795619);}.ds-button-primary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-button-primary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.6}@media(max-width:1023px),(pointer:coarse){.ds-button-primary{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Acción secundaria sobre papel con borde mineral.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-secondary\">Cancel</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:var(--kma-control-height,40px);padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;background:var(--kma-surface,#fffefc);color:var(--kma-fg,#1c1f22);border-color:var(--kma-border,#d4d0c8);transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-button-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--kma-subtle,#eae7e1);}.ds-button-secondary:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--kma-primary,#795619);}.ds-button-secondary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-button-secondary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.6}@media(max-width:1023px),(pointer:coarse){.ds-button-secondary{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-secondary{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "Acción discreta con fondo transparente.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-ghost\">View details</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:var(--kma-control-height,40px);padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:var(--kma-fg,#1c1f22);transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-button-ghost:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--kma-subtle,#eae7e1);}.ds-button-ghost:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--kma-primary,#795619);}.ds-button-ghost:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-button-ghost:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.6}@media(max-width:1023px),(pointer:coarse){.ds-button-ghost{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-ghost{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Destructive Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-destructive",
      "description": "Acción destructiva con fondo, borde y texto de error.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-destructive\">Delete project</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-destructive{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:var(--kma-control-height,40px);padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;background:var(--kma-danger-bg,#fff1f3);color:var(--kma-danger,#b4233e);border-color:var(--kma-danger-border,#f1c3cd);transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-button-destructive:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--kma-danger-bg,#fff1f3) 85%,var(--kma-danger,#b4233e));}.ds-button-destructive:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--kma-primary,#795619);}.ds-button-destructive:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-button-destructive:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.6}@media(max-width:1023px),(pointer:coarse){.ds-button-destructive{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-destructive{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Campo compartido con etiqueta visible, foco ocre y texto de lectura recta.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-project-name\">Project name</label><input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-project-name\" placeholder=\"Enter a project name\" />",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--kma-fg,#1c1f22);font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:20px}.ds-field{width:100%;min-height:40px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--kma-border,#d4d0c8);border-radius:4px;background:var(--kma-surface,#fffefc);color:var(--kma-fg,#1c1f22);caret-color:var(--kma-primary,#795619);font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-field::placeholder{color:var(--kma-muted,#62655f);opacity:1}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--kma-primary,#795619);}.ds-field[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--kma-danger,#b4233e)}.ds-field[aria-invalid=\"true\"]:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--kma-danger,#b4233e)}.ds-field:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:1023px),(pointer:coarse){.ds-field{min-height:44px;font-size:16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-field{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Navegación grafito con selección dorada tenue y objetivos de 44 px.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Workspace\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#dashboard\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>Dashboard</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#projects\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"/></svg>Projects</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{--kma-primary:#ebc773;--kma-selected:#373326;--kma-fg:var(--kma-brand-fg,#f2efea);--kma-muted:var(--kma-brand-muted,#b9bcb6);width:248px;padding:12px;background:var(--kma-brand,#1c1f22)}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--kma-muted);font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-nav-item+.ds-nav-item{margin-top:4px}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--kma-selected);color:var(--kma-primary);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--kma-selected);color:var(--kma-fg)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--kma-primary);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-warning",
      "description": "Etiqueta semántica suave; el texto identifica el estado además del color.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge-warning\">Pending review</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge-warning{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:calc(infinity * 1px);background:var(--kma-warning-bg,#fff7e7);color:var(--kma-warning,#865b08);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--kma-warning-border,#eed9a9);font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:-.025em}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Superficie de papel plana, delimitada por una regla mineral.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-heading\" id=\"ds-panel-heading\">Project details</h2><p class=\"ds-panel-text\">Review project information and audit evidence.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{overflow:hidden;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--kma-border,#d4d0c8);border-radius:8px;background:var(--kma-surface,#fffefc);color:var(--kma-fg,#1c1f22)}.ds-panel-heading{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-heading,Manrope),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:28px}.ds-panel-text{margin:0;color:var(--kma-muted,#62655f);font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review Pipeline",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Tres tramos conectados; revisión pendiente se destaca con grafito y oro. La muestra presenta estados sin inventar recuentos.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-pipeline\" aria-label=\"Review pipeline\"><a class=\"ds-stage ds-stage-first\" href=\"#pending\"><span class=\"ds-stage-label\"><span class=\"ds-stage-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Pending review</span><span class=\"ds-count\">—</span></a><a class=\"ds-stage\" href=\"#review\"><span class=\"ds-stage-label\"><span class=\"ds-stage-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>In review</span><span class=\"ds-count\">—</span></a><a class=\"ds-stage\" href=\"#delivered\"><span class=\"ds-stage-label\"><span class=\"ds-stage-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Delivered</span><span class=\"ds-count\">—</span></a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-pipeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--kma-border,#d4d0c8);border-radius:8px}.ds-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;min-height:120px;padding:16px 12px;background:var(--kma-surface,#fffefc);color:var(--kma-fg,#1c1f22);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease,box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-stage+.ds-stage{border-left:1px solid var(--kma-border,#d4d0c8)}.ds-stage:hover{background:var(--kma-subtle,#eae7e1)}.ds-stage:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--kma-primary,#795619);outline-offset:3px}.ds-stage-first{--kma-fg:#f2efea;--kma-muted:#b9bcb6;--kma-border:#414747;--kma-primary:#ebc773;--kma-subtle:#303638;background:var(--kma-brand,#1c1f22);color:var(--kma-fg)}.ds-stage-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px}.ds-stage-dot{width:6px;height:6px;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--kma-border,#d4d0c8)}.ds-stage-first .ds-stage-dot{background:var(--kma-accent,#d6a43a)}.ds-count{font-family:var(--font-heading,Manrope),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-stage-first .ds-count{color:var(--kma-accent,#d6a43a)}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-stage{padding:20px 24px}}@media(min-width:768px){.ds-stage{min-height:140px}.ds-stage-label{min-height:0}.ds-count{font-size:40px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-stage{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Daylight Section",
    "overview": "Una mesa de revisión con precisión arquitectónica: papel marfil, tinta grafito y luz dorada. Los títulos angulares inclinados dan identidad; el cuerpo recto, las reglas finas y los controles familiares permiten leer y trabajar con calma.\n\nLa composición conecta tareas, datos y evidencias reales. La marca aparece en el contraste de navegación, los recuentos y el encuadre de fotografías, mientras los estados conservan su significado operativo. El tema oscuro cambia el papel por grafito sin perder esta relación entre fondo, superficie y texto.\n\nEste sistema documenta la sustitución aprobada de la identidad petróleo; el [diseño anterior](../premium/DESIGN.md) queda como historia. La [dirección elegida](implementation.md) explica su intención y [PRODUCT.md](../../../../../PRODUCT.md) conserva las restricciones del producto. Los valores se extraen del [estilo global](../../../../../app/globals.css), las [fuentes locales](../../../../../app/layout.tsx), los [controles](../../../../../src/shared/ui/controls.tsx) y los componentes citados abajo; este documento no certifica comprobaciones de navegador ni una compilación final.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Papel marfil y grafito, con dorado para acciones y señales de revisión.",
      "Chakra Petch inclinada para identidad; Manrope para secciones y cifras; Source Sans 3 para lectura.",
      "Superficies planas, reglas finas y esquinas contenidas.",
      "Navegación grafito estable en los dos temas.",
      "Evidencias reales junto a respuestas; informe blanco separado del tema de la aplicación."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** usar los roles compartidos de color y sus variantes de tema; mantener grafito en la navegación.",
      "**Do** conservar Chakra Petch inclinada en página y marca, con lectura recta en formularios y datos.",
      "**Do** mantener alturas mínimas de control, foco visible y estados expresados con texto.",
      "**Do** separar filas con reglas, mostrar evidencias reales junto a respuestas y conservar el informe blanco.",
      "**Do** mantener la procedencia del raster original de acceso junto a su archivo."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** usar el dorado claro como texto pequeño sobre papel; usar el ocre de lectura del tema.",
      "**Don't** aplicar la inclinación de los títulos a campos ni datos de tabla.",
      "**Don't** extender sombras de superposición a paneles y filas del espacio operativo.",
      "**Don't** teñir el informe con los colores del tema ni convertir la ilustración de marca en evidencia de auditoría."
    ]
  }
}
